    `s 263(c)(1) the certificate states the name, jurisdiction of formation or organization and type of entity of each of the constituent entities`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(2) the certificate states that an agreement of merger or consolidation has been approved, adopted, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the constituent entities in accordance with the subsection`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(3) the certificate states the name of the surviving or resulting corporation or partnership`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(4) the certificate states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that its certificate of incorporation shall be its certificate of incorporation`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(5) the certificate states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the certificate`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(6) the certificate states that the executed agreement is on file at an office of the surviving or resulting corporation or partnership and the address of that office`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(7) the certificate states that a copy of the agreement will be furnished, on request and without cost, to any stockholder of any constituent corporation or any partner of any constituent partnership`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 263(c)(8) the certificate states the agreement, if any, required by subsection (d)`  IS A BOOLEAN

