      statements IS A `s 263(c) Statements in the certificate of merger or consolidation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 263(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` MEANS
        statements's `s 263(c)(1) the certificate states the name, jurisdiction of formation or organization and type of entity of each of the constituent entities`
    AND statements's `s 263(c)(2) the certificate states that an agreement of merger or consolidation has been approved, adopted, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the constituent entities in accordance with the subsection`
    AND statements's `s 263(c)(3) the certificate states the name of the surviving or resulting corporation or partnership`
    AND (   (NOT (`dg8 the combination is a merger into a surviving corporation` form))
         OR statements's `s 263(c)(4) the certificate states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that its certificate of incorporation shall be its certificate of incorporation`)
    AND (   (NOT (`dg8 the combination is a consolidation into a resulting corporation` form))
         OR statements's `s 263(c)(5) the certificate states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the certificate`)
    AND statements's `s 263(c)(6) the certificate states that the executed agreement is on file at an office of the surviving or resulting corporation or partnership and the address of that office`
    AND statements's `s 263(c)(7) the certificate states that a copy of the agreement will be furnished, on request and without cost, to any stockholder of any constituent corporation or any partner of any constituent partnership`
    -- (8) "The agreement, if any, required by subsection (d)": required where (d) requires one
    AND (   (NOT (`dg8 the combination ends in an entity that is not a corporation` form
                  AND `the surviving or resulting partnership is formed under the laws of a jurisdiction other than this State`))
         OR statements's `s 263(c)(8) the certificate states the agreement, if any, required by subsection (d)`)

-- Who executes the certificate: "executed in accordance with § 103 of this title, if the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation,
-- or by a general partner, if the surviving or resulting entity is a partnership".
-- src:1288 | executed in accordance with § 103 of this title, if the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation, or by a general partner, if the surviving or resulting entity is a partnership, which states:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(c) (src:1288)
GIVEN form IS A `dg8 Form of a combination`
      `the certificate was executed in accordance with § 103` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
      `the certificate was executed by a general partner of the surviving or resulting partnership` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 263(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF `dg8 the combination ends in a corporation of this State` form
    THEN `the certificate was executed in accordance with § 103`
    ELSE `the certificate was executed by a general partner of the surviving or resulting partnership`

-- A certificate of merger or consolidation may be filed in lieu of the agreement when it is executed as required and states what is required.
-- src:1288 | In lieu of filing the agreement of merger or consolidation, the surviving or resulting corporation or partnership may file a certificate of merger or consolidation, executed in accordance with § 103 of this title, if the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation, or by a general partner, if the surviving or resulting entity is a partnership, which states:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(c) (src:1288)
