DECLARE `s 263(e) Provision applied by reference` IS ONE OF
    `s 251(d) to (f) as applied by s 263(e)`
    `s 255(c) second sentence and (d) to (f) as applied by s 263(e)`
    `ss 259 to 261 as applied by s 263(e)`
    `s 328 as applied by s 263(e)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(e) (src:1298)
