`s 263(e) the provisions that apply to mergers or consolidations between corporations and partnerships` MEANS
    LIST `s 251(d) to (f) as applied by s 263(e)`
       , `s 255(c) second sentence and (d) to (f) as applied by s 263(e)`
       , `ss 259 to 261 as applied by s 263(e)`
       , `s 328 as applied by s 263(e)`

