    AND `the provision is applicable to the merger or consolidation`

§ `s 263(f) Charitable nonstock corporations`

-- Nothing in the section authorizes the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation into a partnership if its charitable status would
-- thereby be lost or impaired. Whether the status would be lost or impaired is a plain input: the text names nobody who decides it (fork F9).
-- src:1299 | (f) Nothing in this section shall be deemed to authorize the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation into a partnership, if the charitable status of such nonstock corporation would thereby be lost or impaired; …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(f) (src:1299)
GIVEN kind IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the corporation would be merged into the partnership and would not continue as the surviving corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 263(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the partnership` MEANS
        `the kind is a charitable nonstock corporation` kind
    AND `the corporation would be merged into the partnership and would not continue as the surviving corporation`
    AND `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired`

-- "but a partnership may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation."
-- src:1299 | but a partnership may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(f) (src:1299)
GIVEN kind IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the charitable nonstock corporation continues as the surviving corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 263(f) the partnership may be merged into the charitable nonstock corporation` MEANS
        `the kind is a charitable nonstock corporation` kind
    AND `the charitable nonstock corporation continues as the surviving corporation`
